+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is an HTTPS-only policy: plaintext HTTP connections are prohibited across all hosts, including internal ones, with no exceptions. This mandate explicitly reverses an earlier decision that had permitted plain HTTP for internal-host traffic as a performance trade-off, so that carve-out no longer applies and encryption is required uniformly for all traffic.
